{
  "info": {
    "name": "azure-storage-account-lab",
    "description": "Testes do lab azure-storage-account-lab: SAS pelo APIM e upload direto no Blob Storage.\n\n1. Importe também `postman/azure-storage-account-lab.postman_environment.json`, gerado por `bash scripts/postman-env.sh`, ou preencha as variáveis da collection.\n2. Rode as pastas em ordem. Cada pasta pede a própria SAS no primeiro request.\n3. Em **2 · Upload direto**, escolha o arquivo no body (binary) do request *Put Blob*.\n\nO arquivo nunca passa pelo APIM: só o pedido da SAS.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "apimBaseUrl",
      "value": "https://<apim>.azure-api.net/uploads"
    },
    {
      "key": "frontendOrigin",
      "value": "https://<stasalweb...>.z15.web.core.windows.net"
    },
    {
      "key": "storageAccount",
      "value": "<stasalup...>"
    },
    {
      "key": "functionHost",
      "value": "<func-...>.azurewebsites.net"
    },
    {
      "key": "fileName",
      "value": "teste-400mb.bin"
    },
    {
      "key": "fileSize",
      "value": "419430400"
    },
    {
      "key": "contentType",
      "value": "application/octet-stream"
    },
    {
      "key": "maxUploadMb",
      "value": "400"
    },
    {
      "key": "uploadUrl",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "blobName",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "blockFileName",
      "value": "blocos.txt"
    },
    {
      "key": "blockFileSize",
      "value": "32"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 · Pedir SAS (Frontend → APIM → Function)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Pedir SAS",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('uploadUrl', body.uploadUrl);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('blobName', body.blobName);",
                  "const qs = Object.fromEntries(body.uploadUrl.split('?')[1].split('&').map(p => p.split('=')));",
                  "pm.test('SAS de um único blob (sr=b)', () => pm.expect(qs.sr).to.eql('b'));",
                  "pm.test('Só create + write (sp=cw)', () => pm.expect(qs.sp).to.eql('cw'));",
                  "pm.test('Só HTTPS (spr=https)', () => pm.expect(qs.spr).to.eql('https'));",
                  "pm.test('User delegation SAS (tem skoid)', () => pm.expect(qs).to.have.property('skoid'));",
                  "pm.test('Resposta do APIM em menos de 1 s', () => pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(1000));",
                  "console.log('blob:', body.blobName, '| expira:', body.expiresOn);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fileName\": \"{{fileName}}\",\n  \"size\": {{fileSize}},\n  \"contentType\": \"{{contentType}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apimBaseUrl}}/sas",
              "host": [
                "{{apimBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "sas"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Mesmo pedido que o frontend faz. Ajuste `fileName` e `fileSize` (bytes) para o arquivo que vai enviar."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 · Upload direto (Frontend → Storage)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Pedir SAS",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('uploadUrl', body.uploadUrl);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('blobName', body.blobName);",
                  "const qs = Object.fromEntries(body.uploadUrl.split('?')[1].split('&').map(p => p.split('=')));",
                  "pm.test('SAS de um único blob (sr=b)', () => pm.expect(qs.sr).to.eql('b'));",
                  "pm.test('Só create + write (sp=cw)', () => pm.expect(qs.sp).to.eql('cw'));",
                  "pm.test('Só HTTPS (spr=https)', () => pm.expect(qs.spr).to.eql('https'));",
                  "pm.test('User delegation SAS (tem skoid)', () => pm.expect(qs).to.have.property('skoid'));",
                  "pm.test('Resposta do APIM em menos de 1 s', () => pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(1000));",
                  "console.log('blob:', body.blobName, '| expira:', body.expiresOn);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fileName\": \"{{fileName}}\",\n  \"size\": {{fileSize}},\n  \"contentType\": \"{{contentType}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apimBaseUrl}}/sas",
              "host": [
                "{{apimBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "sas"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Put Blob (arquivo inteiro)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('uploadUrl')) {",
                  "  throw new Error('Rode antes o pedido de SAS desta pasta.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const secs = pm.response.responseTime / 1000;",
                  "console.log(`upload: ${secs.toFixed(1)} s`);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-ms-blob-type",
                "value": "BlockBlob"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "{{contentType}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "file",
              "file": {}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{uploadUrl}}",
              "host": [
                "{{uploadUrl}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Envia o arquivo inteiro num único PUT. **Escolha o arquivo na aba Body (binary).**\n\nO frontend usa blocos; o Postman não divide o arquivo, então aqui vai de uma vez. Um Put Blob aceita até 5000 MiB."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ler o blob com a mesma SAS (deve falhar)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('uploadUrl')) {",
                  "  throw new Error('Rode antes o pedido de SAS desta pasta.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('403: a SAS não tem permissão de leitura', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{uploadUrl}}",
              "host": [
                "{{uploadUrl}}"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Apagar o blob com a mesma SAS (deve falhar)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('uploadUrl')) {",
                  "  throw new Error('Rode antes o pedido de SAS desta pasta.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('403: a SAS não tem permissão de exclusão', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{uploadUrl}}",
              "host": [
                "{{uploadUrl}}"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 · Upload em blocos (como o frontend faz)",
      "description": "Put Block + Put Block List com dois blocos pequenos de texto, para ver o mecanismo que o frontend usa.",
